        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>A Shared Propensity Towards Food &amp; Alcohol</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }\n  body {\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(80,80,80,.09) 0 1px, transparent 1px 5px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,.22) 0 1px, transparent 1px 5px),\n      #c6c6c4;\n    color: #101010;\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", \"Roboto Condensed\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1056px;\n    min-height: 816px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 31px 43px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    margin: 0 0 18px 20px;\n    font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 50px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.16;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 310px 310px 310px;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .panel { background: #fff; min-height: 606px; }\n  .bar {\n    height: 39px;\n    background: #000;\n    color: white;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 39px;\n    letter-spacing: .4px;\n  }\n  .content { padding: 14px 22px; }\n  p { margin: 0; }\n  .small { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .intro { width: 245px; }\n  .stats { margin: 22px 0 20px 10px; }\n  .stat {\n    height: 73px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 83px 62px 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .percent {\n    font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 43px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .stat-text {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .icon {\n    width: 47px;\n    height: 47px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #000;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 39px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .burger { font-size: 44px; transform: scaleX(1.08); }\n  .female { font-size: 48px; }\n  .male { font-size: 49px; }\n  .left-bottom { margin-top: 0; }\n  .food-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    height: 67px;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .alcohol-list {\n    margin: 10px 0 0 17px;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .method-content { padding: 13px 22px; }\n  .method-content .top-text { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .criteria {\n    margin: 11px 0 20px 20px;\n    padding-left: 15px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .chart-title {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .chart {\n    width: 255px;\n    height: 165px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    padding-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .axis {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 46px;\n    top: 0;\n    height: 150px;\n    border-left: 2px solid #111;\n  }\n  .barrow {\n    height: 39px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .label {\n    width: 46px;\n    padding-right: 9px;\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  .graphbar {\n    height: 18px;\n    border: 2px solid #111;\n    background: #f6f6f6;\n  }\n  .graphbar.dark { background: #666; }\n  .graphbar.black { background: #000; }\n  .value { font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 2px; }\n  .method-heading {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 2px;\n  }\n  .method-copy { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.48; }\n  .results-content { padding: 16px 22px 0; }\n  table {\n    width: 264px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  th, td { border: 2px solid #111; padding: 7px 9px; }\n  th { background: #c9c9c9; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; }\n  th:first-child { width: 146px; text-align: left; }\n  .heads {\n    height: 135px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    color: #111;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .head-drawing {\n    width: 197px;\n    height: 128px;\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 70px;\n    letter-spacing: -18px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .head-drawing span { display: inline-block; transform: scaleX(.8); }\n  .conclusion-content { padding: 18px 24px; }\n  .conclusion-content p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.48; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .conclusion-content strong { font-weight: bold; }\n  .footer {\n    height: 60px;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    width: 265px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .cap {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 30px;\n    background: #000;\n    clip-path: polygon(0 33%, 50% 0, 100% 33%, 50% 65%);\n    margin-right: 11px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .cap:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 12px;\n    background: #000;\n    top: 18px;\n    left: 15px;\n  }\n  .university {\n    font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n  }\n  .citations {\n    width: 700px;\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 1056px) {\n    .page { transform-origin: top left; transform: scale(calc(100vw / 1056)); margin-bottom: calc(-816px + 100vw * .773); }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <h1>A SHARED PROPENSITY TOWARDS FOOD &amp; ALCOHOL</h1>\n\n  <main class=\"columns\">\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">BACKGROUND</div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p class=\"small intro\">Overeating and binge drinking are two of the most common health problems among college students:</p>\n\n        <div class=\"stats\">\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"percent\">48%</div>\n            <div class=\"icon burger\">☷</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-text\">report binge<br>eating problems</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"percent\">63%</div>\n            <div class=\"icon female\">♀</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-text\">of females report binge<br>drinking episodes</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stat\">\n            <div class=\"percent\">85%</div>\n            <div class=\"icon male\">♂</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-text\">of males report binge<br>drinking episodes</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bar left-bottom\">ALCOHOL IS LIKE FOOD</div>\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"food-icons\" aria-label=\"Wine glass, plate with cutlery, beverage can\">♢ ♧ ♙</div>\n        <ul class=\"alcohol-list\">\n          <li>Alcohol is derived from sugar - similar chemical<br>bases as food.</li>\n          <li>Both eating and drinking alcohol activate<br>dopaminergic pathways in the human brain.</li>\n          <li>Addiction models have been applied to both<br>food and alcohol use, as well as correlations<br>between food and alcohol intake documented in<br>animal studies.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">METHOD &amp; MEASURES</div>\n      <div class=\"method-content\">\n        <p class=\"top-text\">200 UCLA Undergraduates (76% females, Mean Age - 22.1) filled out an online survey in one-sitting as part of a longer experimental study with the following exclusionary criteria:</p>\n        <ul class=\"criteria\">\n          <li>Less than 21 years old</li>\n          <li>Self-reported history of eating disorders or<br>substance abuse</li>\n          <li>Abstinence from drinking beer</li>\n          <li>A strict diet and food allergies to experimental<br>stimuli</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p class=\"chart-title\"># of times alcohol was consumed with a meal / month:</p>\n        <div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bar chart of alcohol consumed with a meal per month\">\n          <div class=\"axis\"></div>\n          <div class=\"barrow\"><div class=\"label\">Under 5</div><div class=\"graphbar\" style=\"width:58px\"></div><div class=\"value\">13%</div></div>\n          <div class=\"barrow\"><div class=\"label\">5-10</div><div class=\"graphbar\" style=\"width:109px\"></div><div class=\"value\">25%</div></div>\n          <div class=\"barrow\"><div class=\"label\">11-20</div><div class=\"graphbar dark\" style=\"width:184px\"></div><div class=\"value\">42%</div></div>\n          <div class=\"barrow\"><div class=\"label\">Over 20</div><div class=\"graphbar black\" style=\"width:89px\"></div><div class=\"value\">20%</div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"method-heading\">Alcohol Expectancy Questionnaire (AEQ)</p>\n        <p class=\"method-copy\">A questionnaire measuring one's anticipatory effects of drinking and consuming alcohol.</p>\n\n        <p class=\"method-heading\">Dutch Eating Behavior Questionnaire (DEBQ)</p>\n        <p class=\"method-copy\">A questionnaire assessing one's eating behaviors (since expectancies predict consumption, food expectancies are implicitly implied).</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">RESULTS</div>\n      <div class=\"results-content\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>AEQ / DEBQ</th><th>External</th><th>Emotional</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Relaxation &amp; Tension Reduction</td><td>320</td><td>240</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Arousal &amp; Aggression</td><td>240</td><td>220</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Increased Social Assertiveness</td><td>250</td><td>169</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Physical &amp; Social Pleasure</td><td>210</td><td>114</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"heads\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder head-drawing\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: two profiles, one with food thoughts and one with alcohol thoughts]\">\n            <span>♙</span><span>♙</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bar\">CONCLUSION</div>\n      <div class=\"conclusion-content\">\n        <p><strong>The results support our hypothesis that Food expectancy is positively correlated to alcohol expectancy.</strong></p>\n        <p>DEBQ External eating scale correlated to all AEQ scales, while DEBQ Emotional Eating scale only correlated to some AEQ scales.</p>\n        <p><strong>External eating</strong> had a more consistent relationship with alcohol expectancies, where <strong>Emotional eating</strong> had a less consistent relationship.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"cap\"></div>\n      <div class=\"university\">University of New York,<br>New York!</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"citations\">\n      <strong>STUDY CONDUCTED BY: Carla Ramirez, Francis R. Griffin and Elena Takiyama, UNIVERSITY OF NEW YORK</strong><br>\n      RESOURCES: Walsh, Kathy, Chan, Anthony. \"The psychology of consumption and stress.\" The Pearson Journal, 2017. Temple, Janet, \"Neuroscience of addiction.\" Pearson Journal, 2018.<br>\n      The Science Review, 2018. // Jurgen, Hans, Lee Penelope, \"Consumption Pleasure and Empowerment.\" The Arch Journal, 2020.\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
